 *
 * This script generates AI Analysis for the selected element in Archi, in Persian. The generated documentation will be
 * stored in the Properties tab of the selected element, a json documentation file in the documentation folder, and also
 * displayed in a native dialog box.
 *
 *
 * Requirements:
 *   * jArchi
 *   * AI_REST_JSON.js
 *   * Ollama_Olalla.ajs
 *   * Ollama
 *   * locally-installed AI Model
 *   * Export To Markdown.ajs
 *
 * Version 2.0
 *
 */
